"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in v4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n- Reproducable in v4.4.beta1.official [d33da79d3]\n- Not reproducable in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.11027.2001) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter upgrading a project, I suddenly am getting the warning:\n```\nW 0:00:00:832   The base class script has the \"@tool\" annotation, but this script does not have it.\n  <GDScript Error>MISSING_TOOL\n  <GDScript Source>tracker_scene_default.gd:42\n```\nThe line in question is:\n```gdscript\nclass LocationPart extends BaseConsole.ArrangedColumnsPart: ## A part representing a Location\n```\nThis is extending the class `ArrangedColumnsPart` inside the class `BaseConsole`. `ArrangedColumnsPart` and it's ancestors, do NOT have the `@tool` annotation, thus why this warning is faulty- though, it is obvious what the cause is, as `BaseConsole` DOES have `@tool`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExtend an internal class of a class using `@tool`, see warning. For the MRP, just run the scene and see the warning in the debugger that should not appear.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_bad_tool_warning.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19147056/mrp_bad_tool_warning.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103843/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}